INSIGHT: 🔥 Which Chains Host the Most of BlackRock’s $2B+ $BUIDL Fund?

@Blackrock’s $BUIDL fund has surpassed $2.17B in market value, according to data from https://t.co/0H07ufADYN. But its blockchain distribution reveals some notable leaders.

@Solana $SOL ranks first, hosting approximately $872M of the fund.

@Avax $AVAX follows in second place with around $481.3M.

The figures highlight how tokenized real-world assets are expanding across multiple blockchain ecosystems, with Solana and Avalanche capturing significant shares of one of the largest tokenized fund products.

Which chains dominate Blackrock's biggest crypto product...?

@Blackrock's $BUIDL fund now has a market cap of more than $2B per data from RWA[.]zyx.

However, the chains where it lives may surprise you.

@Solana $SOL is the single biggest host chain, with some $872M of a total $2.17B hosted there.

However, @Avax $AVAX comes as a dominant second place, with some $481.3M.
